    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kua̱r Thɔ-lo-mon",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuäär ni Thɔ-lo-mon ɛ kuäär kä I-thɛ-rɛl kɛɛliw, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ti̱ti̱ kɛ kua̱r kɔaarɛ tin di̱t, Ä-dhar-yaa gat Dha-dok ɛ bo̱o̱th palä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ɛ-li-ɣo-rɛp kɛnɛ Ä-ɣi-yaa gaat Cica a bolithni. Kä cu Yɛ-ɣo-ca-pat gat Ä-ɣi-lud a bulkamiin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Bɛ-na-yaa gat Yɛ-ɣo-ya-da a kuäär rɛ̈m. Kä cu Dha-dok kɛnɛ Ɛb-ya-thar a bööth palä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ä-dhar-yaa gat Na-than te wi̱i̱ kua̱ri kɔaar kua̱r. Kä cu Dha-bud gat Na-than a bo̱o̱th palä kä ɛ määth kua̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ä-ɣi-car a läät cieŋ kua̱r. Kä cu Ä-do-ni-ram gat Ɛ̈bda a läät rɛ̈m.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Thɔ-lo-mon tekɛ kua̱r kɔaarɛ da̱ŋ wäl rɛw kä I-thɛ-rɛl kɛɛliw, ti mockɛ kuäär mi̱eth kɛnɛ ji̱ dhɔaarɛ. La ram kɛl a lät kɛ pay kɛl kɛ ruɔ̱n.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ti̱el ruëc Thɔ-lo-mon",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ji̱ Juda kɛnɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl ŋuankɛ ce̱tnikɛ liɛt yiëër. Kä tɛth lɔcdiɛn kɛ mi̱ethdiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Thɔ-lo-mon I-thɛ-rɛl ruac kɛɛliw a känɛ jɛ ni kiir Yu-pɛ-ree-tidh amäni mun ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt, a räth ni keth I-jëp. Cukɛ Thɔ-lo-mon lätikä kä nöŋkɛ jɛ tho̱lbo̱k kɛ ni̱n teekädɛ diaal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi̱eth Thɔ-lo-mon kɛ cäŋ kɛl, kɛ cuali nuɔ̱p ti jiɛn bäŋuan, kɛ gua̱th mi̱thni ti jiɛn bäkɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ thääk da̱ŋ wäl ti ci cuath, kɛ ɣɔ̱k ti jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw ti ci laak, kɛ det ti kuɔ̱r, kɛ ley, kɛnɛ muɔ̱mni, kɛ kɛɛw kɛ ŋɛcni ti ci kuɔ̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö ruaacɛ jɔk ɣɔaa kiɛɛr Yu-pɛ-ree-tidh kɛɛliw a känɛ nikä Tip-thɛ̈ a wä ni kä Gadha, te kua̱r jɔak kiɛɛr Yu-pɛ-ree-tidh diaal pinydɛ, kä cuɛ tekɛ mal kɛ ji̱ thieekädɛ diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Juda kɛnɛ I-thɛ-rɛl tekɛ mal, a känɛ nikä Daan a wä kä Ber-cɛ-ba, cu ramɔ te ni thaar jiath ŋɔa̱a̱pdɛ. Kɛ ni̱n teekä Thɔ-lo-mon diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Thɔ-lo-mon tekɛ nɛy ti bathdɔɔri ti jiɛn ŋuaan kɛ kui̱ jio̱o̱kni thurbiɛɛlikɛ, kɛnɛ ji̱ jiöŋkööri ti bathdɔɔri da̱ŋ wäl rɛw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛn ji̱ kɔaar kua̱r tɔ̱tɔ̱ mockɛ kuäär mi̱eth kɛnɛ nɛy diaal tin ci ben wi̱i̱ tokä kua̱r ni Thɔ-lo-mon, te ramɔ kɛ paydɛ lät. La kɛn ti diaal a jak kä te wa̱nɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä la kɛn wal a nöŋ jiöŋkööri bä gua̱thnikiɛn, lät ramɔ jɛ kɛɛl kɛ la̱tdɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Thɔ-lo-mon ka̱m ŋäc mi ci ba̱l, kɛ ca̱r mi /ca dëë thɛm. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ŋäcdɛ ŋäc ji̱ käny ca̱ŋ diaal leny, kɛnɛ ŋäc ji̱ I-jëp diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö lenyɛ nɛy diaal tin kɔ̱ŋ kɛ pɛl, pɛli jɛn kä E-than raan Ɛdhra, kɛnɛ Ɣe-man, kɛ Kɛ̈l-kol, kɛnɛ Dar-dɛ̈, gat Ma-ɣol. Kä cu kɛ̈kdɛ räth kä ji̱ thieekädɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä jɛn cuɛ cäätni ti bathdɔɔri diɔ̱k lat. Kä cuɛ diit ti bathdɔɔr kɛl wi̱cdɛ dhieec cak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ruac kɛ kui̱ jiɛn, kɛ kui̱ ŋuer in te kä Lɛ-ba-nɔn amäni lath in la do̱ny puɔ̱ny pa̱a̱ny. Kä cuɛ ruac bä kɛ kui̱ leeyni, kɛnɛ diit, kɛ muɔl piɛny, kɛnɛ rɛc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 4:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu naath ben dööri diaal ba ŋäc Thɔ-lo-mon ben liŋ, amäni kua̱r wec muɔ̱ɔ̱n tin ca ŋäcdɛ liŋ cukɛ ben.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.4.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.4.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
